    heroLocalDetail: "Celina families typically deliver at Medical City Frisco, Texas Health Presbyterian Plano, or the new Methodist Celina Medical Center. The drive from most parts of Celina to Frisco is about 15-20 minutes via Preston Road (TX-289) or the Dallas North Tollway extension. The US-380 corridor through Celina is undergoing major expansion, so expect construction delays. The historic downtown square around Hunt Street and Ohio Drive is the heart of the community, with the Celina City Hall and the iconic water tower anchoring the town center. For third-trimester walks, the Celina Community Park on Preston Road has paved trails, and the nearby Hagerman National Wildlife Refuge offers more extensive walking paths about 20 minutes east." ,
