      paragraph: "Massachusetts licenses Certified Nurse-Midwives (CNMs) through the Board of Registration in Nursing, and they practice in hospitals and birth centers across the state. Certified Professional Midwives (CPMs) are not currently licensed in Massachusetts, though legislative efforts continue. Brigham and Women\u2019s Hospital and Massachusetts General Hospital both have CNM-attended birth options. Birth Sanctuary Cambridge offers midwife-led out-of-hospital care." ,
