      { name: "Hasbro Children\u2019s Hospital" , address: "593 Eddy St, Providence, RI 02903" , thumbnail: "/images/providence-ri-hospital-hasbro-childrens-pvd.webp" , nicuLevel: "IV" , doulaPolicy: "Doulas welcome in NICU as support persons, check current visitor policy" , midwifeFriendly: false, waterBirth: "Not applicable \u2014 pediatric/NICU facility" , medicaid: true, lactation: true, privateRooms: true, url: "https://www.lifespan.org/hospitals/hasbro-childrens-hospital" , paragraph: "Hasbro Children\u2019s, part of Rhode Island Hospital and the Lifespan system, provides the state\u2019s only Level IV NICU, the highest designation available, equipped to handle the most complex neonatal cases. The NICU is staffed 24/7 by board-certified neonatologists from the Brown University Division of Neonatal-Perinatal Medicine. Hasbro works in close collaboration with Women & Infants for maternal-fetal transport and coordinated care. The hospital accepts RI Medicaid and provides family support services including lactation consultation and social work for NICU families." }
