    culture: "Lakewood is Colorado's fifth-largest city with about 154,000 residents, situated just west of Denver against the Rocky Mountain foothills. The birth community benefits from proximity to Denver's robust doula and midwifery network, with St. Anthony Hospital providing hospital-based maternity care directly in Lakewood and Intermountain Health Lutheran Hospital in nearby Wheat Ridge offering the only maternity services in Jefferson County. Colorado's Medicaid doula coverage has expanded access for families across the Front Range, and the city's location gives families easy access to both hospital and freestanding birth center options in the greater Denver metro area." ,
